```

When this content is processed by the TiddlyWiki5 lexer, the CSS code inside the style tags is not being highlighted properly. The style tags themselves are also not being rendered with the correct token type.

I'm using Pygments version 2.14.0 and this issue appears to be specific to the TiddlyWiki5 lexer's handling of CSS code blocks.

